    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYlKHNvz5YZc21B1ONa6eycd1xk.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhB4HENY--uLski8lu_W8LLjPwUU.jpeg"><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>本期简介】</span></strong></p><p><span>大家好呀！本期节目是百物语系列的第19期，非常抱歉小羊进组了没办法参加录制，所以本期节目由金鱼一个人来给大家讲故事。感谢本期投稿的四位听友：Echo、刘律、神秘人、被窝里面5只猫，也欢迎各位想投稿的朋友添加节目微信号：yididenglu404 来分享你的经历。</span></p><p><span>本期的几个故事灵异程度很低，没有吓人的情节，所以大家都可以放心收听。希望大家喜欢本期节目，收听愉快。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>提示：</span></strong></p><p><span>【对这类故事感到害怕的朋友】建议按照</span><strong><span>标题或简介</span></strong><span>，选择其他内容的节目收听哦，或者在白天收听~</span><strong><em><span>（但本期真的不可怕）</span></em></strong></p><p><span>【喜欢听友投稿系列的朋友】欢迎在节目列表中搜索百物语，或者直接去内容专辑中收听其他精彩故事。</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>⏰</span><strong><span>本期时码】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 听友Echo：老房子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 听友刘律（小刘）：床上的黑洞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> 听友神秘人：梦中的纸条</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 听友被窝里面5只猫：大白狗的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 金鱼分享，小橘子我们都很想你呀</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>联系我们】</span></strong></p><p><span>投稿</span><em><span>/</span></em><span>加听友群：添加微信 yididenglu404</span><strong><span>（请备注听友群/投稿）</span></strong></p><p><span>商务合作：添加微信 yddlsw</span><strong><span>（请备注品牌/来意）</span></strong></p><p><span>其他社交平台：微博@异地登录404&nbsp; 小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n"><span>异地登录播客</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G"><span>我属金鱼</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU"><span> 普通小羊</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>背景音乐】</span></strong></p><p><span>片头：@姜之湄&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>帆足圭吾,篠田大介 - 遊園施設</span></p><p><span>Lorien Testard - Flying Waters - Submerged Lights</span></p><p><span>澄镜之水 - ib 恐怖美术馆 Memory+動く絵本</span></p><p><span>Lorien Testard - Lumière - Lumière à l’Aube</span></p><p><span>Super Piano 64,GameChops,Unplugged - Our Painted Family</span></p>]]></description>
