    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYlKHNvz5YZc21B1ONa6eycd1xk.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhB4HENY--uLski8lu_W8LLjPwUU.jpeg"><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>本期简介】</span></strong></p><p><span>大家好，本期是荒诞故事会系列。我们沿用了“地方怪谈”的思路，准备用城市划分来讲讲各个城市发生过的荒诞案件。本期带来的是北京的三则神人怪盗案。如果大家喜欢这种形式和本期的内容，也欢迎在评论区留下下一个你想听的荒诞案件城市~</span></p><p><span>希望大家喜欢本期节目，收听愉快。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>⏰</span><strong><span>本期时码】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 反光镜大盗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 故宫失窃案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2888">48:08</a> 贼喊捉贼</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>联系我们】</span></strong></p><p><span>投稿</span><em><span>/</span></em><span>加听友群：添加微信 yididenglu404</span><strong><span>（请备注听友群/投稿）</span></strong></p><p><span>商务合作：添加微信 yddlsw</span><strong><span>（请备注品牌/来意）</span></strong></p><p><span>其他社交平台：微博@异地登录404&nbsp; 小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n"><span>异地登录播客</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G"><span>我属金鱼</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU"><span> 普通小羊</span></a></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>背景音乐】</span></strong></p><p><span>片头：@姜之湄&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Deister Orchestra - Saccharine Song in 19edo</span></p><p><span>Moins Le Quartet - Lickety Split</span></p><p><span>X-Ray Dog - Midnight Snack</span></p>]]></description>
