  <item>
    <title>Vol.129 荒诞故事会：绝命糖师罗金成</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab8c7dce742e36efcbbaf48</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab8c7dce742e36efcbbaf48</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYlKHNvz5YZc21B1ONa6eycd1xk.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhB4HENY--uLski8lu_W8LLjPwUU.jpeg"><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>本期简介】</span></strong></p><p><span>大家好，本期我们来讲一个荒诞案件。2025年，抖音账号"放牛人与妞妞"意外走红，小牛妞妞和主人亲昵互动的视频让网友大喊好治愈。可没过多久，有人翻出一张旧照片，上面穿囚服的男人，怎么看都像这位"妞妞爸爸"。顺着这条线，一个十年前的荒诞案件再次出现在大家面前。</span></p><p><span>祝大家收听愉快，也提前祝大家国庆假期快乐！</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📖</span><strong><span>案件客观事实参考资料】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://tv.cctv.com/2016/04/19/VIDE5a2xLCwol4DjpCUovP6t160419.shtml" data-url="https://tv.cctv.com/2016/04/19/VIDE5a2xLCwol4DjpCUovP6t160419.shtml"><span>《经济与法》 20160419 特殊“毒”贩</span></a></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>⏰</span><strong><span>本期时码】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 走红的账号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 2015年的缉毒往事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 罗金成</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 付诸行动</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>联系我们】</span></strong></p><p><span>投稿</span><em><span>/</span></em><span>加听友群：添加微信 yididenglu404</span><strong><span>（请备注听友群/投稿）</span></strong></p><p><span>商务合作：添加微信 yddlsw</span><strong><span>（请备注品牌/来意）</span></strong></p><p><span>其他社交平台：微博@异地登录404&nbsp; 小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n"><span>异地登录播客</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G"><span>我属金鱼</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU"><span> 普通小羊</span></a></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>背景音乐】</span></strong></p><p><span>片头：@姜之湄&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>mama!mi