    <title>Vol.126 9·18开封博物馆文物被盗案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9d3300a0210c197dce469b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9d3300a0210c197dce469b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYlKHNvz5YZc21B1ONa6eycd1xk.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhB4HENY--uLski8lu_W8LLjPwUU.jpeg"><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>本期简介】</span></strong></p><p><span>大家好，本期我们来讲一桩被称为"建国以来最大文物盗窃案"的案子——1992年开封"9·18"博物馆文物被盗案。</span></p><p><span>1992年9月18日凌晨，一场大雨里，开封博物馆69件文物一夜消失，其中包括北宋白釉珍珠地鹦鹉纹瓷枕这样的国家一级文物，涉案文物估价约6亿元。展厅大门锁完好无损，红外报警系统一声没响，现场只留下一地碎玻璃、8个夹子、8块布和一把玻璃刀。开封警方联合多地警方，用三个多月时间侦破了案件，将嫌疑人全部抓捕归案。</span></p><p><span>希望大家喜欢本期节目，收听愉快。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📖</span><strong><span>案件客观事实参考资料】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>原始报道与官方资料</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://tv.cctv.com/2020/07/21/VIDEkdQRBicQv1C4MHlPkzA1200721.shtml" data-url="https://tv.cctv.com/2020/07/21/VIDEkdQRBicQv1C4MHlPkzA1200721.shtml"><span>央视纪录频道《国宝大案录》第一集 九·一八大案</span></a><br><a href="https://www.12371.cn/2020/08/03/VIDA1596420296947335.shtml" data-url="https://www.12371.cn/2020/08/03/VIDA1596420296947335.shtml"><span>共产党员网《国宝大案录》第一集（在线观看）</span></a><br><a href="http://jishi.cntv.cn/guobaoqianzhijiuyibadaanzhiyiwangdajin/classpage/video/20110321/100628.shtml" data-url="http://jishi.cntv.cn/guobaoqianzhijiuyibadaanzhiyiwangdajin/classpage/video/20110321/100628.shtml"><span>央视纪实台《档案》：9.18大案之一网打尽（2011-03-20）</span></a><br><a href="https://jishi.cctv.com/2017/09/04/VIDEVt3NJNxjfzPjJYZhXFOG170904.shtml" data-url="https://jishi.cctv.com/2017/09/04/VIDEVt3NJNxjfzPjJYZhXFOG170904.shtml"><span>北京纪实-档案《九一八大案 一网打尽》（2017-09-04）</span></a><br><a href="https://tv.cctv.com/v/v1/VIDEBcDL9C8feluTVLNvToMU110801.html" data-url="https://tv.cctv.com/v/v1/VIDEBcDL9C8feluTVLNvToMU110801.html"><span>央视《普法栏目剧》：荣誉的力量·九·一八大案再纪实（七）</span></a><br><a href="http://www.cntv.cn/program/ysptz/20070524/107139.shtml" data-url="http://www.cntv.cn/program/ysptz/20070524/107139.shtml"><span>CCTV《千里追踪明青花缠枝莲纹大盘》（被盗文物追回实录）</span></a></p><p><strong><span>新闻报道</span></strong></p><p><a href="http://hn.cnr.cn/hngbwh/20160513/t20160513_522134194.shtml" data-url="http://hn.cnr.cn/hngbwh/20160513/t20160513_522134194.shtml"><span>央广网：开封博物馆近日闭馆搬迁 曾发生馆藏文物盗窃案</span></a><br><a href="http://paper.people.com.cn/hqrw/html/2016-06/06/content_1725922.htm" data-url="http://paper.people.com.cn/hqrw/html/2016-06/06/content_1725922.htm"><span>人民网环球人物：武和平「公开才有力量」</span></a></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>⏰</span><strong><span>本期时码】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 案件开始，1992年9月18日，开封市博物馆失窃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 线索追踪，白色桑塔纳？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 转战武汉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4146">01:09:06</a> 四个嫌疑人</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiDFEwHMdIpZdJ23B_YZvf8dyDXy.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpfu3ONVoNxAEfijSHMhLpXiBZDQ.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnnRxM-94ys_omtN371z1KzQ5as9.png"><blockquote><p><span>部分丢失文物详情，图源CCTV《国宝大案录》</span></p></blockquote><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>联系我们】</span></strong></p><p><span>投稿</span><em><span>/</span></em><span>加听友群：添加微信 yididenglu404</span><strong><span>（请备注听友群/投稿）</span></strong></p><p><span>商务合作：添加微信 yddlsw</span><strong><span>（请备注品牌/来意）</span></strong></p><p><span>其他社交平台：微博@异地登录404&nbsp; 小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/Abm3mhfzd9n"><span>异地登录播客</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6j8n2hf1U4G"><span>我属金鱼</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/5yWy9f2MtyU"><span> 普通小羊</span></a></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>背景音乐】</span></strong></p><p><span>片头：@姜之湄&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>조영욱 - 귀여운 뱀파이어</span></p><p><span>조영욱 - Four Seasons(Vivaldi - Winter)<